# Batch files MUST stay CRLF — cmd.exe mis-parses LF .bat files (eats the first
# character of each line: `chcp` -> `cp`, `echo` -> `cho`), which silently breaks
# the launchers on some machines. Force CRLF on checkout regardless of platform.
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Everything else: normalize to LF in the repo, let Git handle working-tree endings.
* text=auto
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch.
*.png binary
